ema自動證明歷史同一；不推同場交往、官職起訖或神仙事實。","primary_reading_ref":"source-evidence/zhou041-wangbao-ws2432538/primary-reference-resolutions.json","source_reference_binding":{"kind":"offline_ai_editorial_primary_reference","ref":"source-evidence/zhou041-wangbao-ws2432538/primary-reference-resolutions.json","resolution_id":"d-zhou041-guanling"},"human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p003","text":"老子修道德，其學以自隱無名為務。居周久之，見周之衰，乃遂去。至關，關令尹喜曰：「子將隱矣，彊為我著書。」於是老子乃著書上下篇，言道德之意五千餘言而去，莫知其所終。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"老子","kind":"person","person_id":"jg1_ag9_033","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m003-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"尹喜","kind":"person","person_id":"2b1_faa_7h8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m003-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"老子","kind":"person","person_id":"jg1_ag9_033","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan","book_id":"b-shiji-063","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-063-laohan"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p010","text":"弟昔因多疾，亟覽九仙之方；晚涉世途，常懷五嶽之舉。同夫關令，物色異人；譬彼客卿，服膺高士。上經說道，屢聽玄牝之談；中藥養神，每稟丹沙之說。頃年事遒盡，容髮衰謝，芸其黃矣，零落無時。還念生涯，繁憂總集。視陰愒日，猶趙孟之徂年；負杖行吟，同劉琨之積慘。河陽北臨，空思鞏縣；霸陵南望，還見長安。所冀書生之魂，來依舊壤；射聲之鬼，無恨他鄉。白雲在天，長離別矣，會見之期，邈無日矣。援筆攬紙，龍鍾橫集。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","voice_scope":"王襃→周弘讓","mentions":[{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p010:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"弟","kind":"pronoun","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA","status":"resolved_contextual","source_role":"bao","source_letter_role_binding":{"kind":"fixed_zhou041_letter_reference","contract_ref":"source-evidence/zhou041-wangbao-ws2432538/source-ner-contract.json","role_key":"bao","paragraph_sha256":"0527e993d3691cb8bb62a546b0786f030bb8860370e2ede147d3208dca568e8d"},"inte